>  Direction (FLAGS_CODEBOOK.md section 1; STUDENT 02_prepare_data.do:4-7): in 
> stored row
>  i->j, the reverse flow (j->i arrivals) is reported by i (exporter) and the s
> ame-direction
>  flow (i->j arrivals) by j (importer). Importer-reported trade is reported by
